{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"a46d0e842f853fea4b353d9940b895e24119acb02f63bf33f1cea081257a172d","ja":"美奈子農場","zh":"美奈子农场","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"09a775a1277190b96a7f2d81ffc2bb0ed109ad6ab2750863f9f24346ca15f893","ja":"第2回、『劇場ゲーム部』の時間です！　今回は\nのんびりシミュレーションゲームをプレイします♪","zh":"第2期，《剧场游戏部》的时间到了！这次\n要悠闲地玩一款模拟类游戏♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1ad888fced17c81889c4ea7bb423c68da9be10139854a7481482b02f38798483","ja":"えへへ、実は事前に結構やってて……だから今日は、\n私の畑と仲良しの住民さんを紹介しますね！","zh":"嘿嘿，其实我提前玩了挺多的……所以今天，\n就来介绍一下我的农田和关系很好的居民朋友吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"04bd22ba8481a6d29815703f637cb0a74053b9b99528a929fbf455f6ca05e2ea","ja":"生放送ということで、みなさんの感想も募集します！\nでは『ネオ牧場』の世界へ、行ってみましょー！","zh":"既然是直播，也会向大家征集感想！\n那么就去往《新牧场》的世界看看吧——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329","ja":"数分後……","zh":"过了几分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6aa9150c972ed088fc6bbe670f40efba9455722bd54ce4e6d7a4bb042f8a1aa8","ja":"じゃあ畑でとれた野菜を使って料理をして……\n住民のみんなにプレゼントしていきまーす！","zh":"那么，就用田里收获的蔬菜做成料理……\n去送给所有的居民吧——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7d08f54bf110a057743cd3ecc4707da067dabb040a3f2f2dafa5f6211bc16700","ja":"あ、みなさん質問ありがとうございます！　えーと……\n「どうして好感度MAXなのにまだプレゼントを？」","zh":"啊，谢谢大家的提问！那个……\n“为什么好感度都MAX了还要送礼物呢？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4e57caacb560b99143bf01ae66c31c8917d7bd785da7b863cff8c317d9a0d569","ja":"あはは、たしかにそうなんですけど……やっぱり\r\n料理は毎日たくさん食べてもらいたくって！","zh":"啊哈哈，确实是那样没错……但我还是\n希望大家每天都能多吃点我做的饭嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"817882a2d95b7a5ee7a6b7210cdb1a772c972ec37fcc653c691c771a73c77f99","ja":"だからこうして今日も……って、ええっ！？\n料理拒否！？　なんでなんでー！？","zh":"所以今天也这样……等等，诶诶！？\n拒绝做饭！？为什么为什么啊——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f39df5cb1a3936823bc00236b951013b42269780758bed61424d2b47f7e95f91","ja":"あ……ゲームだと1日1回しか\nプレゼントできないんだった……。","zh":"啊……在游戏里1天只能\n送1次礼物来着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a34177d553ad53ccd5921eb894f1f04ffc54a1612fa333f977b7bd27ecfeb90d","ja":"たくさん食べてもらえないのって、\nなんだかもどかしいですよね……。","zh":"要是不能让人多吃一点，\n总觉得有些干着急呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d0a81eb32ec739b084edc8e27b215eae9737c3df65b5e6001191fb8501b993fa","ja":"え！？　「その感想、美奈子ちゃんだけじゃ……？」\nそ、そうかな！？","zh":"诶！？“那个感想，不只有美奈子……”？\n会、会是这样吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"91b77e356d484cce34d63a11d6e2c8ceb7ca873fd120d0584cb244e6295b27ad","ja":"ええっと、じゃあ私と同じ気持ちだよ～って人が\nいたら教えてくださいね！","zh":"那个，如果有和我抱有同样心情的人，\n还请告诉我哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"95023c8bbf968592414d7d0144093bec1c47f3775a35a9ae216fe5cb43675d8c","ja":"じゃあ、次は何を……あっ！　明日料理コンテストが\nあるからその準備をしようかな！　……わあっ！？","zh":"那么，接下来该做什么呢……啊！明天有\n料理大赛，去准备一下吧！……哇啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a6db9e38d5d64413303fb21f065c7c03ddcf3ce4f3e8fe6408178f4883d3e925","ja":"「優勝」「もう優勝」「勝ったな」「優勝しかない」\n……な、なんか「優勝」の文字がいっぱい……！？","zh":"“优胜”“已经优胜了”“赢定啦”“只能是优胜了”\n……总、总感觉满屏都是“优胜”这两个字……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1018.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e2ab0a67294b96088874b9d828043e6caf93d0682ce4f638c23f04a81eb74c79","ja":"えへへっ♪\nみなさん、ありがとうございま～す♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪\n各位，非常感谢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
